QRC9VXdoxdmsjlBOqqCQ8klcwfrvYTN6a-WCLzMa3sKiw&oe=6AFC8B94"}, "display_name": "Project Hail Mary: Journey Among The Stars", "keywords": ["space", "scifi", "survival", "alien", "Rocky"], "long_description": "**Project Hail Mary: Journey Among the Stars** is a mixed-reality adventure set in the cinematic world based on Andy Weir\u2019s best-selling sci-fi novel, where players join Ryland Grace and Rocky during a pivotal untold chapter of the mission.\n\n\nWork together in the face of disaster to keep the Hail Mary intact and bring their world-saving cargo to Eridani \u2014 Rocky\u2019s home planet, and Grace\u2019s new home.\n\n\n{1419059380147330}\n- **Work alongside Rocky** to keep the mission alive, and experience humanity\u2019s last hope firsthand\n{1056164043800857}\n- **Manage your ship** and its precious cargo as you travel through the stars\n\n{2170182270509733}\n- **Diagnose failing systems,** and improvise scientific solutions\n\n\nThe Hail Mary is enroute from Tau Ceti to 40 Eridani A. Ryland Grace and his friend and crewmate Rocky must work together in the face of disaster to keep the ship intact and bring their world-saving cargo to Eridani \u2014 Grace\u2019s new home.\n\nThe mixed reality version requires a 2.5meter by 2.5meter playarea.\nA free update will be coming soon which allows a VR mode to be selected instead of mixed reality if you prefer.", "short_description": "Project Hail Mary: Journey Among the Stars is a mixed-reality adventure set in the cinematic world based on Andy Weir\u2019s best-selling sci-fi novel, where players join Ryland Grace and Rocky during a pivotal untold chapter of the mission."}]}, "developer_name": "Maze Theory Games Studio Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/legal/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Maze Theory Games Studio Ltd", "support_website_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/", "website_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/", "category": null, "comfor